  "segments": [
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Back in their Media College dorm room, exhausted Bu Xiaogu wakes up late in the morning after her roommate Qin Xiao let her sleep through her alarm. Listen to their conversation first.",
      "gap": 0.8
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "啊？已经十一点了！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "秦箫，你怎么不叫我呀？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "qin_xiao",
      "t": "我发誓，我叫了你一百遍了。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "qin_xiao",
      "t": "好吧，后来想想还是算了。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "qin_xiao",
      "t": "你最近太累了，应该多睡一会儿。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "qin_xiao",
      "t": "你想吃什么？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "qin_xiao",
      "t": "我去给你买。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "不用了，我现在没时间吃饭。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "昨晚我又不小心睡着了。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "我的论文还没写完呢。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "今天上班还迟到了！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "qin_xiao",
      "t": "那你快去吧，路上小心！",
      "gap": 0.9
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Now let's go through it line by line with the English translation.",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "啊？已经十一点了！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'What? It is already eleven!'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "秦箫，你怎么不叫我呀？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Qin Xiao, how come you did not wake me up?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "qin_xiao",
      "t": "我发誓，我叫了你一百遍了。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'I swear, I called you a hundred times.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "qin_xiao",
      "t": "好吧，后来想想还是算了。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Alright, on second thought I decided to let it go.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "qin_xiao",
      "t": "你最近太累了，应该多睡一会儿。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'You have been too tired lately and should sleep a bit longer.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "qin_xiao",
      "t": "你想吃什么？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'What would you like to eat?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "qin_xiao",
      "t": "我去给你买。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'I will go buy it for you.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "不用了，我现在没时间吃饭。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'No need, I have no time to eat right now.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "昨晚我又不小心睡着了。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Last night I accidentally fell asleep again.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "我的论文还没写完呢。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'My thesis is still not finished yet.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "今天上班还迟到了！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'And I am late for work today too!'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "qin_xiao",
      "t": "那你快去吧，路上小心！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Then hurry off, and take care on the way!'",
      "gap": 0.65
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Now let's listen to the whole conversation one last time.",
      "gap": 0.75
    },
