    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Xiaogu rushes out of the dorm late for studio prep with her graduation thesis still unfinished. You learned how to tell the hour with \"dian\", say you fell asleep with \"shuizhao\", and talk about being late for work with \"shangban chidao\". See you next time!",
      "gap": 0.5
